## UI Framework: Mantine 9.x Only

- **Mantine packages in use**: `@mantine/core`, `@mantine/dates`, `@mantine/form`, `@mantine/hooks`, `@mantine/notifications`, `@mantine/modals`, `@mantine/charts`, `@mantine/schedule`
- **Icons**: `@tabler/icons-react` only
- **Font**: Vazirmatn (Persian RTL, `dir="rtl"`)

## Forbidden Libraries

- ❌ No Tailwind CSS (removed)
- ❌ No shadcn/ui components
- ❌ No Radix primitives
- ❌ No `lucide-react` icons
- ❌ No `clsx`, `tailwind-merge`, or `cn()` utility

## Theme & Colors

- Use Mantine's semantic color props: `c`, `bg`, `variant`, `color`
- No hardcoded hex colors, no `bg-gray-*`, no `orange.9`
- Theme switching via `ColorSchemeScript` + `MantineProvider` + header toggle
- Light/dark modes must both work correctly
- User preference persists in localStorage

## RTL Support

- App is Persian right-to-left
- `<html lang="fa" dir="rtl" {...mantineHtmlProps}>`
- All layouts must respect RTL
